#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1469
msgid "Which PayPal buttons (e.g. Pay Later, Venmo, SEPA, iDEAL, Mercado Pago, Bancontact, etc.) will appear?"
msgstr "Hvilke PayPal-knapper (f.eks. Pay Later, Venmo, SEPA, iDEAL, Mercado Pago, Bancontact osv.) vises?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1473
msgid "The PayPal buttons are shown automatically based on several factors, including:"
msgstr "PayPal-knapperne vises automatisk baseret på flere faktorer, herunder:"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1475
msgid "The buyer’s country"
msgstr "Køberens land"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1476
msgid "Their device type"
msgstr "Deres enhedstype"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1477
msgid "The funding sources they’ve enabled"
msgstr "De finansieringskilder, de har aktiveret"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1479
msgid "As a result, each buyer may see a different set of buttons. Pay Later options vary by country and may display different buttons."
msgstr "Som følge heraf kan hver køber se et andet sæt knapper. Pay Later-muligheder varierer efter land og kan vise forskellige knapper."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1485
msgid "How can I hide specific PayPal buttons?"
msgstr "Hvordan kan jeg skjule specifikke PayPal-knapper?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1489
msgid "By default, all PayPal buttons are enabled. To hide specific buttons, use the <strong>Disable Specific Payment Buttons</strong> option."
msgstr "Som standard er alle PayPal-knapper aktiveret. For at skjule specifikke knapper skal du bruge indstillingen <strong>Deaktiver specifikke betalingsknapper</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1490
msgid "Example: To hide the Pay Later button on the Checkout Page:"
msgstr "Eksempel: For at skjule Pay Later-knappen på betalingssiden:"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1492
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1509
msgid "Go to <strong>PayPal Settings</strong> > Checkout Page"
msgstr "Gå til <strong>PayPal-indstillinger</strong> > Betalingsside"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1493
msgid "Find the <strong>Disable Specific Payment Buttons</strong> setting."
msgstr "Find indstillingen <strong>Deaktiver specifikke betalingsknapper</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1494
msgid "Select <strong>Pay Later</strong> from the dropdown list."
msgstr "Vælg <strong>Pay Later</strong> fra rullelisten."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1495
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1511
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1517
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1534
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1540
msgid "Click <strong>Save Changes</strong>."
msgstr "Klik på <strong>Gem ændringer</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1502
msgid "How can I show only the \"PayPal\" button on the Checkout page?"
msgstr "Hvordan kan jeg kun vise \"PayPal\"-knappen på betalingssiden?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1506
msgid "To display only the \"PayPal\" button on the Checkout page, follow these steps:"
msgstr "For kun at vise \"PayPal\"-knappen på betalingssiden skal du følge disse trin:"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1507
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1530
msgid "Step 1: Update PayPal Settings"
msgstr "Trin 1: Opdater PayPal-indstillinger"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1510
msgid "Under <strong>Disable Specific Payment Buttons</strong>, select <strong>Credit or Debit Card</strong> and any other methods you want to hide."
msgstr "Under <strong>Deaktiver specifikke betalingsknapper</strong> skal du vælge <strong>Kredit- eller debetkort</strong> og andre metoder, du vil skjule."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1513
msgid "Step 2: Update Advanced Card Payments Settings"
msgstr "Trin 2: Opdater indstillinger for avancerede kortbetalinger"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1515
#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1538
msgid "Go to <strong>Advanced Card Payments</strong> settings."
msgstr "Gå til indstillingerne for <strong>Avancerede kortbetalinger</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1516
msgid "Disable the option <strong>Enable Advanced Credit/Debit Card</strong>."
msgstr "Deaktiver indstillingen <strong>Aktiver avanceret kredit-/debetkort</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1519
msgid "Once you save the changes in both sections, only the \"PayPal\" button will appear on the Checkout page."
msgstr "Når du gemmer ændringerne i begge sektioner, vises kun \"PayPal\"-knappen på betalingssiden."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1525
msgid "How can I show only the \"Credit or Debit Card\" payment method on the Checkout page?"
msgstr "Hvordan kan jeg kun vise betalingsmetoden \"Kredit- eller debetkort\" på betalingssiden?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1529
msgid "To display only the \"Credit or Debit Card\" payment method on the Checkout page, follow these steps:"
msgstr "For kun at vise betalingsmetoden \"Kredit- eller debetkort\" på betalingssiden skal du følge disse trin:"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1532
msgid "Go to <strong>PayPal Settings > Checkout Page</strong>."
msgstr "Gå til <strong>PayPal-indstillinger > Betalingsside</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1533
msgid "Disable the <strong>Enable PayPal</strong> option."
msgstr "Deaktiver indstillingen <strong>Aktiver PayPal</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1536
msgid "Step 2: Enable Advanced Credit/Debit Card Payments"
msgstr "Trin 2: Aktiver avancerede kredit-/debetkortbetalinger"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1539
msgid "Enable the option <strong>Enable Advanced Credit/Debit Card</strong>."
msgstr "Aktiver indstillingen <strong>Aktiver avanceret kredit-/debetkort</strong>."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1542
msgid "Once you save the changes in both sections, only the \"Credit or Debit Card\" payment method will appear on the Checkout page."
msgstr "Når du gemmer ændringerne i begge sektioner, vises kun betalingsmetoden \"Kredit- eller debetkort\" på betalingssiden."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1548
msgid "What is PayPal Pay Later?"
msgstr "Hvad er PayPal Pay Later?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1552
msgid "PayPal Pay Later lets your customers split their purchases into interest-free payments over time, such as \"Pay in 4\" or monthly installments. You get paid in full upfront, while customers enjoy flexible payment options."
msgstr "PayPal Pay Later lader dine kunder dele deres køb op i rentefrie betalinger over tid, såsom \"Betal i 4 rater\" eller månedlige afdrag. Du får betalt fuldt ud med det samme, mens kunderne nyder fleksible betalingsmuligheder."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1553
msgid "This can help increase your sales, with many merchants seeing higher conversion rates and larger order sizes."
msgstr "Dette kan hjælpe med at øge dit salg, da mange forhandlere oplever højere konverteringsrater og større ordrestørrelser."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1556
msgid "Learn more about Pay Later on PayPal’s website."
msgstr "Lær mere om Pay Later på PayPals hjemmeside."

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1564
msgid "How can I contact support or request a new functionality?"
msgstr "Hvordan kan jeg kontakte support eller anmode om ny funktionalitet?"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1569
msgid "If you have any questions, encounter an issue, or have a new functionality request, please create a support ticket on our official support page at:"
msgstr "Hvis du har spørgsmål, støder på et problem eller har en anmodning om ny funktionalitet, skal du oprette en supportbillet på vores officielle supportside på:"

#: ppcp/includes/class-ppcp-paypal-checkout-for-woocommerce-gateway.php:1698
msgid "Click to Enable Google Pay"
msgstr "Klik for at aktivere Google Pay"

